## Loading order

Always read `foundation.md` first — it establishes definitions, scope, applicability, and the red-flag schema all slices reference. Then read exactly your role's slice (if one exists for your role; otherwise stop after foundation). **Do not load other roles' slices** — that defeats progressive disclosure and leaks the wrong agent's concerns into your context.

